invariant: INV-55
file: tls.c
catches: unit
reason: ch_close sends the owed KeyUpdate before its close_notify, a
  rekey and a record that no data record follows, where RFC 9846 section
  4.7.3 owes the answer before application data alone. bin/unit requires
  the close of a session that owes an answer to send one alert record.

--- old
    if (t->keys) {
        (void)tlsi_send_alert(t, 1, ALERT_CLOSE_NOTIFY);
    }
--- new
    if (t->keys) {
        if (t->key_update_owed) {
            (void)hspost_send_key_update(t);
        }
        (void)tlsi_send_alert(t, 1, ALERT_CLOSE_NOTIFY);
    }
